ents Summit</u></strong></span></a></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">25th November 2025</span></span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Grand Hotel Birmingham</span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: #223341;"><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/annual-conference-awards-ceremony-2026?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Annual Conference &amp; Awards Ceremony 2026</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #0f476b;"><br /><strong>3rd - 4th March 2026</strong><br />Carden Park, Cheshire</span></span></p> </td> 
